<title>USA: Amex May short interest rose by 2.4 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Amex May short interest rose by 2.4 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Amerian Stock Exchange said Wednesday that short interest rose 2.4 million shares in the month ended May 15 to about 159 million shares, a fourth consecutive monthly record.</p>
<p>The Exchange said that in the previous month, short interest totaled 156.6 million shares.</p>
